e on 33.5%, 10.2 points clear of Liberal.","To win, One Nation needs about 38.2% of the 43.2% of votes that went to other candidates to flow its way ahead of Liberal.","After preferences One Nation leads Haylett 61.8% to 38.2%.","Preferences from other candidates are flowing about 46.6% to One Nation.","Projecting that flow across every vote counted so far points to a win (about 53.6% to One Nation after preferences).","The Labor candidate is third on 16.8%. Labor voters tend to put One Nation last, which hurts it here."],"baseline":{"winner":{"candidate":"HAYLETT, Martha","code":"ALP"},"holder":{"code":"ALP","name":"HAYLETT, Martha","note":"Won at the 2022 election"},"final":[{"candidate":"HAYLETT, Martha","code":"ALP","pct":52.99},{"candidate":"STALEY, Louise","code":"LIB","pct":47.01}],"margin":2.99,"primary":{"OTH":16.55,"IND":2.8,"GRN":5.96,"ALP":38.55,"LIB":36.15}},"held_by":"ALP","mp":{"name":"HAYLETT, Martha","code":"ALP","note":"Won at the 2022 election","running":true,"pct":16.8},"swing":{"OTH":-10.1,"IND":-2.0,"ON":33.5,"LIB":-12.8,"NAT":9.2,"ALP":-21.7,"GRN":3.8},"prior":{"winner":"LIB","win_prob":0.9412208848863375,"final":[{"candidate":"Liberal","code":"LIB","pct":60.95573682646666},{"candidate":"Labor","code":"ALP","pct":39.04426317353334}],"primary":{"OTH":9.91,"IND":1.99,"GRN":8.58,"ALP":21.64,"LIB":35.47,"ON":22.42}},"projection":{"winner":"LIB","win_prob":0.641,"final":[{"candidate":"READ, Megan","code":"LIB","pct":52.0},{"candidate":"BUXTON, Donna","code":"ON","pct":48.0}],"basis":"preference model","sd":5.51,"on_win_prob":0.359,"live_weight":1.0}}